\pard\b\fs20 Grand Sky Melee\b0\par
\fs16\par
Grand Sky Melee is a large free-for-all multiplayer melee high up in the air.\par
Apart from a few exceptions, it is played exclusively with classic clonks and fundamental settlement objects.\par
Although the difficulty is very high, beginners can learn a lot here about what clonking means.\par
The main part of the game is building a defensible settlement and developing resources.\par
